  <ProbNet type="BayesianNetwork">
    <Comment showWhenOpeningNetwork="false"><![CDATA[CPCS network, from the CPCS-PM patient case simulation system (Pradhan et al., 1994). Obtained from the UAI 2008 evaluation set (mpe/cpcs, Ergo format) distributed by R. Dechter's group, and converted to ProbModelXML. The conditional probability tables come already expanded: the noisy-MAX structure of the original is not present in the distributed copy. Node and state names are anonymous in that copy.]]></Comment>
